    <string name="accessibility_service_description">GestureControl uses this service to find out which app is on screen (gestures work only in the apps you selected), to show the hand cursor and to perform taps, swipes and Back / Home actions that you trigger with your hand. It does not read screen content or what you type, and stores nothing.</string>

